    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "For buyers, the process begins by choosing a book."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "they can either view the book details or see a list of new copies"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "Alternatively, they can also view a list of used copies."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "If they choose to view the book details, they have the option to then view a list of new copies or proceed to select a copy and end the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "On the other hand, if they choose to view a list of used copies, they can evaluate the list and then select their preferred copy to complete the process."
